  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/page/Category:Waist_items\" title=\"Category:Waist items\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_ItemSlot_Waist.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure> \n<h2><span id=\"Kormor.27s_Belt\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Kormor's_Belt\">Kormor's Belt</span></h2>\n<table class=\"striped\" style=\"clear: right; border: 1px #DDAAFF solid; margin: 4px; width: 100%; --bg-color-1:#DDA0DD;--bg-color-1-dark:#773777;--bg-color-2:#EEDDFF;--bg-color-2-dark:#3A2F45;--header-color:#DDA0DD;--header-color-dark:#773777;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\" width=\"15%\">Minimum level\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\" width=\"42.5%\">18\n</td>\n<th rowspan=\"11\" class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\" width=\"42.5%\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Belt_Generic.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Belt_Generic.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"398\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Item Type\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">Clothing / Belt\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\"><a href=\"/page/Slot\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Slot\">Slot</a>\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">Waist\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Race Absolutely Required\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><a href=\"/page/None\" title=\"None\">None</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Binding\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><a href=\"/page/Bind\" title=\"Bind\">Bound to Character&#160;on Acquire</a>, <a href=\"/page/Exclusive\" title=\"Exclusive\">Exclusive</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Durability\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">110\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Material\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r705484\">.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip{cursor:pointer;position:relative}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip.no-icon{border-bottom:1px dashed #999999}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip>span.popup.tooltip{background-color:#EEEEEE;background-color:var(--background-color-neutral,#EEEEEE);border:1px solid #333333;border-radius:3px;box-shadow:3px 5px 10px;color:#202122;color:var(--color-base,#202122);cursor:text;display:none;margin:0px;max-width:500px;padding:5px;width:250px;z-index:10000}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.narrow{width:100px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.fill{padding:5px 12px;width:max-content}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.wide{width:450px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.custom{max-width:80vw}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip{display:block;position:absolute}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.above{bottom:100%;top:auto;margin-bottom:5px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.middle{bottom:auto;top:50%;margin-top:-1em}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.below{bottom:auto;top:100%;margin-top:5px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.left{left:0px;right:auto}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center{left:50%;margin-left:-125px;right:auto}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.narrow{margin-left:-50px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.fill{left:-262px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;right:-262px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.wide{margin-left:-225px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.right{left:auto;right:0px}</style><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Leather\" title=\"Leather\">Leather</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Leather\" title=\"Leather\">Leather</a>:</b> <b>Leather</b> armor is made of the hide of animals. It provides decent protection without excessively restricting the user's movements.</span></span> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Hardness\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">15\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF; width: 150px;\">Base Value\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF; width: 450px;\"><span style=\"display: none;\">0010002000</span>10,002<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">pp<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Platinum Piece</a></span></span>&#160;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">0.10 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Sins_of_Attrition\" title=\"Sins of Attrition\">Sins of Attrition</a></b>, Any chest&#160;; <a href=\"/page/Tower_of_Despair\" title=\"Tower of Despair\">Tower of Despair</a>, <a href=\"/page/Nythirios\" title=\"Nythirios\">Nythirios</a> chest\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Wild_Mage_Surge\" title=\"Wild Mage Surge\">Wild Mage Surge</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Wild_Mage_Surge\" title=\"Wild Mage Surge\">Wild Mage Surge</a></b><br /><b>Caster level:</b> 15<br /><b>Charges: </b>3 (3/day)</span></span> <b>—</b> 3 Charges&#32;(Recharged/Day:3)</li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Wizardry\" title=\"Wizardry\">Archmagi</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Wizardry\" title=\"Wizardry\">Archmagi</a>: </b>This item grants the wearer +200 maximum <a href=\"/page/Spell_point\" title=\"Spell point\">spell points</a>. <a href=\"/page/Sorcerer\" title=\"Sorcerer\">Sorcerers</a> and <a href=\"/page/Favored_Soul\" title=\"Favored Soul\">Favored Souls</a> gain up to double spell points from items.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Confounding_Enchantment\" title=\"Confounding Enchantment\">Confounding Enchantment</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Confounding_Enchantment\" title=\"Confounding Enchantment\">Confounding Enchantment</a>:</b> The shifting nature of the magic that enchants this ring makes the effect hard to determine.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Wild_Mage\" title=\"Named item sets\">Wild Mage</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Wild_Mage\" title=\"Named item sets\">Wild Mage</a>:</b> <a href=\"/page/Spell_Penetration\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Spell Penetration\">Spell Penetration VIII</a>: Your 8th level spells and spells lower than 8th level gain a +2 bonus to the die roll to penetrate the target's Spell resistance. (Non-stacking)</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Kormor%27s_Belt.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Kormor%27s_Belt.png/420px-Kormor%27s_Belt.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"509\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Kormor%27s_Belt.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#DDAAFF\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EEDDFF\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><i>This fine leather belt vibrates with strange magical energy. It once belonged to the eccentric Wild Mage, Kormor.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260816175122\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.067 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.120 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3342/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 21454/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6304/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 2/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n124.25%  128.276     44 Template:IO\n100.00%  103.243      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  103.243      1 -total\n 95.24%   98.327      1 Template:Named_Clothing\n 41.86%   43.215      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 40.55%   41.865      2 Template:IsLama